 r←∆MimeParts text;boundary;lines;contentType
⍝ Returns the parts of the multipart message `text`: a vector with one vector of lines per part.
⍝ Signals an error when the closing boundary is missing.
 contentType←text ∆Header'Content-Type'
 boundary←{⍵↑⍨¯1+⍵⍳'"'}contentType↓⍨9+⊃⍸'boundary="'⍷contentType
 lines←SMTP.Message.SplitLines text
 'Closing boundary is missing'⎕SIGNAL 11/⍨~(⊂'--',boundary,'--')∊lines
 lines←(¯1+lines⍳⊂'--',boundary,'--')↑lines
 r←1↓¨(lines≡¨⊂'--',boundary)⊂lines
